WEBVTT

00:12:28.356 --> 00:12:31.396
And whether or not
people see it is not ...

00:12:32.356 --> 00:12:33.636
it's not your fault,

00:12:33.636 --> 00:12:36.836
but affirm yourself
and make yourself known.

00:12:36.876 --> 00:12:39.796
You know, take up space,
even if they're not giving it to you,

00:12:39.836 --> 00:12:41.796
don't wait for their permission to speak.

00:12:42.596 --> 00:12:45.636
Be brilliant whether or not
they want you to be.

00:12:45.676 --> 00:12:47.436
WPR: Well, thank you so much, Luvvie,

00:12:47.476 --> 00:12:49.996
I know we're all going to be waiting
with bated breath

00:12:50.036 --> 00:12:51.836
for the news around this book.

00:12:51.836 --> 00:12:53.636
LAJ: Thank you so much for having me.

00:12:53.676 --> 00:12:56.036
TED has been so significant in my journey.